sequenceDiagram
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ConfigMapR as ConfigMapReconciler
    participant Viper as In-Memory Config<br/>(Viper)
    participant SatEngine as Saturation Engine
    participant Kalman as Kalman Filter<br/>(in-process)
    participant Prom as Prometheus / Thanos Querier<br/>9091/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Actuator as DirectActuator
    participant PromScrape as Prometheus Scraper

    Note over K8sAPI,ConfigMapR: Flow 2: ConfigMap-Driven Configuration Reload
    K8sAPI->>ConfigMapR: Watch ConfigMaps<br/>(label: app.kubernetes.io/name: wva)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    ConfigMapR->>Viper: Update in-memory config
    Viper->>SatEngine: Trigger limiter rebuild

    Note over SatEngine,Actuator: Flow 1: Saturation-Based Autoscaling Loop
    SatEngine->>Prom: GET /api/v1/query<br/>PromQL: KV-cache saturation,<br/>queue depth, throughput<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    Prom-->>SatEngine: Metric values
    SatEngine->>Kalman: Apply noise reduction filter
    Kalman-->>SatEngine: Smoothed metrics
    SatEngine->>SatEngine: Compute target replicas<br/>(saturation curve analysis)
    SatEngine->>K8sAPI: PATCH Scale subresource<br/>Deployments / LeaderWorkerSets<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    SatEngine->>K8sAPI: POST Event<br/>(scaling decision record)

    Note over PromScrape,SatEngine: Flow 3: Prometheus Metrics Scraping
    PromScrape->>SatEngine: GET :8443/metrics<br/>HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token +<br/>TokenReview/SubjectAccessReview
    SatEngine-->>PromScrape: Prometheus metrics response
